,12.2,1976,63,101,21]],"links":[["Walla Walla County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/washington/walla-walla-county"],["ARC or PLC in Walla Walla County","/arc-plc/washington/walla-walla-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. In 2025, June to July came in at 7% of normal on the middle, and July to August at 27%. In 2026 so far, May to June and June to July each sit at 25% on the middle. July to August is the driest pair at 0.66 inches normal, and November to December the wettest at 3.21.</p>"}
